  - localizationKey: GAMEPLAY_Shotgun_PartBarrelDescription
    languages:
      English: A 12-gauge barrel and magazine tube, cold enough to burn bare skin.
        Pitted near the muzzle but still straight down its length. On its own it's
        just a pipe. At a workbench, with the rest of the gun, it could fire again.
      German: 
      Russian: 
      French: 
      Japanese: 
      Korean: 
