  - localizationKey: GAMEPLAY_Shotgun_PartForendDescription
    languages:
      English: The pump slide and its action bars, wrapped in a greasy rag. It rattles
        when you shake it, but nothing is cracked. One of five parts needed to rebuild
        a shotgun at a workbench.
